MSISDN                 TS29.329
SGSN-Number            TS29.272
Supported-Features     TS29.229
Feature-List-ID        TS29.229
Feature-List           TS29.229
GMLC-Number            TS29.272
3GPP-AAA-Server-Name   TS29.273


; Type: Information Elements
; Command: LCS-Routing-Info-Request
; Section: 5.2.1.1
; Table: 5.2.1.1/1
; Page: 9
